WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 4=

5
01:39.240 --> 01:40.690
I'm feeling generous.

6
01:41.440 --> 01:42.800
I'm willing to give you another chance.

7
01:43.210 --> 01:45.130
You've served me well these past few days.

8
01:45.570 --> 01:46.240
I'm quite pleased.

9
01:47.930 --> 01:49.960
Before I recover and take my leave,

10
01:50.770 --> 01:53.010
if you manage to please me,

11
01:54.160 --> 01:55.080
then I'll...

12
01:59.960 --> 02:01.160
I'll take you back with me.

13
02:02.290 --> 02:03.210
And I'll have you castrated.

14
02:04.520 --> 02:05.800
You'll become

15
02:06.130 --> 02:09.130
a eunuch attending to me day and night.

16
02:15.640 --> 02:16.690
I'm teasing you.

17
02:17.250 --> 02:18.200
Look how scared you are.

18
02:21.640 --> 02:22.600
Right here, right now,

19
02:23.690 --> 02:24.880
I do rather like you.

20
02:27.760 --> 02:28.850
You always know what to say.

21
02:29.130 --> 02:30.720
Keep me company and chat with me tonight.

22
02:37.570 --> 02:37.970
All right.

23
02:42.200 --> 02:43.530
That day, the county magistrate said

24
02:44.850 --> 02:46.250
your father was Yan Zhanzhi.

25
02:46.810 --> 02:47.880
Why did your whole family

26
02:48.640 --> 02:49.720
move to Lingnan?

27
02:55.760 --> 02:56.760
Do you remember

28
02:57.440 --> 02:58.290
the Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors?

29
03:02.480 --> 03:03.160
Ten years ago,

30
03:03.920 --> 03:05.760
seven military governors led their troops into the capital.

31
03:06.160 --> 03:08.530
Sheng'an was engulfed in war, with marauding soldiers everywhere.

32
03:09.480 --> 03:11.410
Father fled south with our family.

33
03:20.060 --> 03:23.540
(The Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors, The Yan Family Flees South)

34
03:26.970 --> 03:28.579
(Xie Jinghui, Yan Shang's Mother) (Here, have this. Eat slowly.)

35
03:28.621 --> 03:29.460
(Yan Sanlang, Yan Shang's Younger Brother)

36
03:30.570 --> 03:31.920
(Young Yan Dalang) (Come on, eat while it's warm.)

37
03:38.690 --> 03:39.160
(Stop!)

38
03:40.370 --> 03:40.850
(Don't run!)

39
03:43.640 --> 03:44.440
(Run!)

40
03:46.320 --> 03:46.920
(Run!)

41
04:08.440 --> 04:09.370
My mother and younger brother

42
04:10.250 --> 04:11.480
both died in that war.

43
04:13.090 --> 04:14.010
My elder brother was badly wounded

44
04:14.440 --> 04:15.200
and was left deeply traumatized.

45
04:15.850 --> 04:16.690
My father was crippled

46
04:17.570 --> 04:18.400
and gave himself over to drink and despair.

47
04:20.130 --> 04:20.730
From then on,

48
04:21.730 --> 04:23.010
the gifted Scholar Yan would be no more.

49
04:25.130 --> 04:27.570
They say the imperial streets were strewn with nobles' bones.

50
04:27.840 --> 04:28.490
The Yan family wasn't

51
04:29.170 --> 04:30.400
the only one wiped out.

52
04:32.810 --> 04:33.400
That's right.

53
04:34.880 --> 04:36.440
It wasn't just one family

54
04:37.760 --> 04:38.880
or one clan

55
04:39.810 --> 04:40.520
that perished in the Rebellion.

56
04:46.100 --> 04:47.780
(Young Mu Wanyao)

57
04:58.080 --> 04:58.570
Yan Shang.

58
05:01.810 --> 05:02.570
I'm leaving

59
05:03.960 --> 05:04.930
first thing tomorrow.

60
05:11.930 --> 05:12.760
Once we part,

61
05:14.320 --> 05:15.130
we'll likely never

62
05:15.690 --> 05:16.880
see each other again.

63
05:20.320 --> 05:21.080
Take care, Your Highness.

64
05:23.250 --> 05:24.400
It's not even dawn yet,

65
05:25.370 --> 05:27.200
and you've already lost your resolve to come along with me?

66
05:29.610 --> 05:30.570
I've done all I can.

67
05:31.320 --> 05:31.840
I suppose

68
05:32.880 --> 05:33.880
this can't be forced.

69
05:40.610 --> 05:41.640
I've always had trouble sleeping.

70
05:42.930 --> 05:43.960
Since this is our last night,

71
05:45.960 --> 05:47.280
tell me a story.

72
05:48.490 --> 05:49.760
If it helps me sleep soundly,

73
05:50.440 --> 05:51.880
I'll grant your request.

74
05:53.010 --> 05:53.440
How about it?

75
06:19.400 --> 06:20.050
Go ahead.

76
06:24.760 --> 06:26.520
Lingnan has many strange tales.

77
06:27.880 --> 06:29.170
My favorite of them all

78
06:30.250 --> 06:31.280
is called Lady Jiang.

79
06:33.050 --> 06:36.810
Legend says a woman of the Jiang clan once went into the mountains for herbs.

80
06:37.960 --> 06:38.370
But then,

81
06:39.570 --> 06:40.490
she encountered a tiger.

82
06:44.280 --> 06:45.170
Did it eat her?

83
06:46.570 --> 06:47.640
With the tiger's sharp claws and fangs,

84
06:48.170 --> 06:49.170
a frail woman like her

85
06:49.730 --> 06:50.730
could never fight it off.

86
06:51.640 --> 06:52.050
So,

87
06:52.840 --> 06:54.170
she made a dire wager

88
06:54.810 --> 06:55.810
with the tiger.

89
06:56.690 --> 06:57.280
What was the wager?

90
06:58.170 --> 06:58.640
She said,

91
06:59.690 --> 07:01.610
"Meeting you today, I know I won't survive.

92
07:02.640 --> 07:03.690
If you consume me entirely,

93
07:04.200 --> 07:05.080
I'll die without complaint.

94
07:05.960 --> 07:06.400
But,

95
07:07.050 --> 07:08.130
if you fail to eat me,

96
07:09.010 --> 07:11.010
even if I die and become a vengeful spirit,

97
07:11.930 --> 07:13.130
I'll never let you go."

98
07:24.840 --> 07:26.050
The tiger began to devour her.

99
07:27.050 --> 07:28.810
It had almost devoured her completely.

100
07:37.200 --> 07:39.880
(The daughter of the Yaoguang Star will bring prosperity to the dynasty.)

101
07:40.490 --> 07:42.370
(Given the Princess's auspicious name,)

102
07:42.610 --> 07:45.610
(she's the ideal bride for Meng Baiyu.)

103
07:47.370 --> 07:48.760
(Once the Princess marries,)

104
07:49.520 --> 07:51.690
(North Jing will know peace.)

105
07:56.170 --> 07:57.400
The disparity in strength was immense.

106
07:58.320 --> 07:59.570
Defeat seemed inevitable.

107
08:04.080 --> 08:04.610
And yet,

108
08:05.320 --> 08:07.200
a piece of her little finger fell into a crack.

109
08:08.170 --> 08:09.610
However hard the tiger clawed,

110
08:10.200 --> 08:10.930
it couldn't get it out.

111
08:12.050 --> 08:12.760
At daybreak the next morning,

112
08:13.570 --> 08:14.690
the villagers were astonished

113
08:15.640 --> 08:17.610
to see her dressed in crimson, riding the tiger

114
08:18.400 --> 08:19.080
back home.

115
08:20.400 --> 08:21.130
She had won the wager.

116
08:22.690 --> 08:23.170
She said,

117
08:24.520 --> 08:25.170
"Starting today,

118
08:25.960 --> 08:27.440
I am the tiger's master."

119
08:36.040 --> 08:36.520
That's the end.

120
08:38.680 --> 08:39.450
Get some rest, my lady.

121
08:52.680 --> 08:53.370
(At that moment,)

122
08:54.610 --> 08:56.920
(my heart thundered in my chest and my blood ran hot,)

123
08:58.450 --> 08:59.520
(yet I felt no fear.)

124
09:00.920 --> 09:02.680
(What I'd long kept hidden in my heart)

125
09:03.160 --> 09:04.370
(had been laid bare by his words.)

126
09:05.040 --> 09:06.680
(The tiger lurking in my heart)

127
09:07.520 --> 09:08.610
(could no longer be restrained.)

128
09:10.330 --> 09:10.850
(That's right.)

129
09:12.280 --> 09:13.490
(No more shrinking back or hesitation.)

130
09:14.760 --> 09:16.450
(Moving forward is just one big gamble.)

131
09:17.090 --> 09:17.680
(If I lose,)

132
09:18.490 --> 09:19.400
(I die, that's all.)

133
09:20.250 --> 09:20.920
(If I win,)

134
09:21.640 --> 09:23.130
(I become the tiger's master.)

135
09:52.800 --> 09:53.760
That's a wonderful story.

136
09:54.520 --> 09:55.680
It speaks right to my heart.

137
09:59.130 --> 09:59.560
Yan Shang,

138
10:00.400 --> 10:01.090
what do you want?

139
10:09.250 --> 10:10.040
I want to go to Sheng'an

140
10:10.760 --> 10:11.730
and enroll at the Imperial Academy.

141
10:13.280 --> 10:13.560
All right.

142
10:14.400 --> 10:15.010
I promise.

143
10:49.920 --> 10:50.490
Shang.

144
10:58.850 --> 10:59.250
Father.

145
11:03.160 --> 11:03.850
Are you leaving?

146
11:11.010 --> 11:11.640
I've failed you as a son.

147
11:12.370 --> 11:13.490
I can no longer stay to care for you.

148
11:21.160 --> 11:22.250
Sheng'an is a vast place.

149
11:23.130 --> 11:24.040
Plenty of room for you to make your mark.

150
11:25.610 --> 11:28.160
I've spent my life achieving little, and now I'm old with nothing to show.

151
11:29.490 --> 11:30.640
If there's one thing I'm proud of,

152
11:31.800 --> 11:32.490
it's you.

153
11:36.880 --> 11:37.330
Go on.

154
11:42.660 --> 11:44.640
♪Books bear no blade♪

155
11:46.280 --> 11:50.910
♪Yet tens of thousands of scrolls can pierce the sky♪

156
11:52.040 --> 11:53.679
Sheng'an may be vast, but it's not easy to live there.

157
11:53.721 --> 11:55.560
♪My body is the furnace, flames reach the clouds♪

158
11:56.450 --> 11:58.560
If one day you've had enough and grown tired of it,

159
11:59.010 --> 11:59.920
come back to Lingnan.

160
12:01.090 --> 12:02.280
Whatever fortunes life brings,

161
12:04.850 --> 12:05.640
you'll always have a home here.

162
12:06.690 --> 12:10.460
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

163
12:13.450 --> 12:13.970
What's wrong?

164
12:16.820 --> 12:20.120
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

165
12:20.970 --> 12:21.449
Nothing.

166
12:21.491 --> 12:26.060
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

167
12:26.360 --> 12:29.690
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

168
12:31.060 --> 12:33.220
♪By noon, the mist will lift♪

169
12:33.450 --> 12:33.850
Father...

170
12:36.160 --> 12:36.520
Take care.

171
12:40.490 --> 12:45.160
♪With rosy clouds, I bid the moon goodnight♪

172
12:45.860 --> 12:48.820
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

173
12:52.520 --> 12:52.970
Shang,

174
12:54.520 --> 12:55.970
take good care of yourself on the road.

175
12:59.760 --> 13:00.130
I will.

176
13:00.800 --> 13:01.400
Don't fall ill.

177
13:06.090 --> 13:06.560
Brother,

178
13:08.330 --> 13:09.090
safe travels.

179
13:16.850 --> 13:17.280
Xiaozhou,

180
13:18.800 --> 13:19.520
if one day

181
13:20.560 --> 13:21.250
I can return,

182
13:22.520 --> 13:22.970
from then on,

183
13:24.210 --> 13:25.130
our family will stay together

184
13:26.250 --> 13:27.160
and spend the rest of our lives

185
13:27.970 --> 13:28.640
in this little thatched cottage.

186
13:32.560 --> 13:33.330
If I don't return,

187
13:35.970 --> 13:36.450
you'll have to

188
13:37.370 --> 13:38.370
keep this family going.

189
13:39.730 --> 13:40.370
Our elder brother has had it hard.

190
13:41.450 --> 13:42.450
Take good care of Father.

191
13:47.680 --> 13:48.210
Brother...

192
13:51.010 --> 13:52.130
Must you really go?

193
14:02.400 --> 14:02.850
Brother!

194
14:04.210 --> 14:05.280
Remember to write to us.

195
14:05.560 --> 14:07.160
Father and I can read your letters to our brother.

196
14:08.250 --> 14:11.800
♪I still fear my ambitions may go unfulfilled♪

197
14:16.970 --> 14:17.330
I will!

198
14:22.420 --> 14:27.020
♪I gaze at high peaks and sails far away♪

199
14:27.520 --> 14:30.720
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

200
14:31.690 --> 14:36.720
♪Frost on my shoulders, joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

201
14:37.090 --> 14:40.320
♪A thousand miles of lights keep me company♪

202
14:41.660 --> 14:43.860
♪By noon, the mist will lift♪

203
14:44.060 --> 14:46.290
♪Rivers will bend♪

204
14:46.690 --> 14:49.820
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

205
14:51.220 --> 14:56.400
♪Tread the boundless clouds and rise with the wind♪

206
14:56.450 --> 14:59.340
♪March to the gates with fearless hearts♪

207
15:11.160 --> 15:11.680
Yan Shang,

208
15:12.490 --> 15:13.370
have you thought this through?

209
15:14.400 --> 15:16.210
Sheng'an's no easy place to live.

210
15:17.490 --> 15:18.520
Across the whole Huai Dynasty,

211
15:18.920 --> 15:20.970
every predator is packed into Sheng'an.

212
15:21.800 --> 15:23.040
Whether it's intelligence,

213
15:23.400 --> 15:24.090
scheming,

214
15:24.520 --> 15:25.250
flattery,

215
15:25.880 --> 15:26.560
or influence,

216
15:27.280 --> 15:28.490
someone will always outdo you.

217
15:29.640 --> 15:31.640
Every day, every moment,

218
15:32.210 --> 15:33.560
they're locked in fierce competition.

219
15:41.210 --> 15:41.970
Listen,

220
15:42.370 --> 15:43.920
don't think being clever

221
15:44.640 --> 15:47.160
means you'll make a name for yourself at the Imperial Academy.

222
15:47.490 --> 15:48.920
I grew up in Sheng'an.

223
15:49.850 --> 15:52.730
I've seen countless brilliant people

224
15:52.920 --> 15:53.760
never get the chance they deserve

225
15:54.280 --> 15:55.010
and live out ordinary lives.

226
15:59.560 --> 16:00.250
Thank you for the warning.

227
16:01.210 --> 16:01.520
Your Highness,

228
16:02.280 --> 16:02.970
we're ready to depart.

229
16:14.400 --> 16:15.130
Shang!

230
17:28.040 --> 17:28.650
What are you writing?

231
17:28.740 --> 17:29.740
(Dear Brother and Sister, greetings. Ten days on, a thousand li apart.)

232
17:30.520 --> 17:30.890
A letter home.

233
17:31.890 --> 17:33.560
I'll send them all home together once we reach Sheng'an.

234
17:34.120 --> 17:36.450
"Dear Brother and Sister, greetings.

235
17:36.930 --> 17:38.080
Ten days on,

236
17:38.210 --> 17:39.800
a thousand li apart."

237
17:41.490 --> 17:41.890
How nice it must be

238
17:42.280 --> 17:43.320
to get a letter like that.

239
17:44.760 --> 17:46.250
I've never gotten a letter from anyone.

240
17:56.730 --> 17:57.970
We're nearly at Sheng'an.

241
17:59.010 --> 18:00.760
You'd better spend less time on trivial matters

242
18:01.520 --> 18:02.690
and more time reading poetry and prose.

243
18:03.210 --> 18:05.170
Imitate the masters and submit your work.

244
18:05.520 --> 18:07.280
That's the shortcut to success for a scholar.

245
18:09.890 --> 18:10.360
What a shame.

246
18:11.120 --> 18:11.890
I'm no good at writing poetry

247
18:12.520 --> 18:13.250
and I don't even like reading it.

248
18:14.890 --> 18:15.840
That's not good.

249
18:21.320 --> 18:21.890
Fang Tong,

250
18:23.490 --> 18:24.410
where are we now?

251
18:25.210 --> 18:25.730
My lady,

252
18:26.170 --> 18:27.170
we're almost at Lantian Relay Station.

253
18:30.080 --> 18:31.360
How come it's starting to rain?

254
18:54.010 --> 18:54.490
My lady,

255
18:55.120 --> 18:55.760
the rain is too heavy.

256
18:56.010 --> 18:56.840
Let's wait a while before we go on.

257
18:57.210 --> 18:58.450
There could be mudslides and rockfalls.

258
18:58.890 --> 18:59.250
All right.

259
19:05.560 --> 19:05.890
Speak.

260
19:08.450 --> 19:09.320
Your wound has only just healed.

261
19:10.280 --> 19:11.280
Go easy on the wine.

262
19:12.730 --> 19:13.800
You do like to meddle.

263
19:40.280 --> 19:40.930
What are you doing?

264
19:41.730 --> 19:42.040
I...

265
19:43.170 --> 19:44.120
I'm covering your ears.

266
19:45.890 --> 19:46.730
How did you know?

267
19:48.520 --> 19:49.320
That day in the cave,

268
19:49.840 --> 19:50.629
you had a terrible fever...

269
19:50.671 --> 19:51.040
Shut up!

270
20:11.650 --> 20:12.010
Your Highness,

271
20:12.970 --> 20:13.490
the rain has stopped.

272
20:28.120 --> 20:29.080
What else do you know?

273
20:31.010 --> 20:31.520
Nothing else.

274
20:33.040 --> 20:33.760
Tell me the truth.

275
20:37.040 --> 20:37.760
If I do,

276
20:39.800 --> 20:41.080
you might get angry.

277
20:41.520 --> 20:42.730
You think I'll be pleased

278
20:43.560 --> 20:44.800
if you stop halfway through?

279
20:47.080 --> 20:47.490
Speak!

280
20:50.930 --> 20:51.690
I also know

281
20:53.210 --> 20:54.520
that perhaps on a stormy night,

282
20:55.800 --> 20:56.730
someone tried to kill you.

283
20:57.730 --> 20:59.650
You were in grave danger, on the brink of death,

284
21:01.360 --> 21:02.410
and it left you traumatized.

285
21:03.170 --> 21:03.800
Go on.

286
21:06.360 --> 21:07.010
Perhaps it happened

287
21:09.410 --> 21:11.080
when you were married off to North Jing.

288
21:14.040 --> 21:14.450
I'm sorry.

289
21:17.250 --> 21:17.840
Yan Shang,

290
21:18.690 --> 21:19.730
if you dare tell anyone

291
21:20.120 --> 21:21.690
what we discussed today,

292
21:22.410 --> 21:24.170
I'll rip out your tendons and skin you alive!

293
21:24.730 --> 21:25.170
I promise.

294
21:25.650 --> 21:26.490
I won't tell a soul.

295
21:35.410 --> 21:37.280
The Sheng'an you've longed for is right ahead.

296
21:38.010 --> 21:39.080
I'll give you this chance

297
21:39.760 --> 21:41.360
to reach it on your own.

298
21:42.320 --> 21:43.450
Fang Tong, let's go.

299
21:43.560 --> 21:43.890
Understood.

300
22:22.260 --> 22:24.020
(Sheng'an)

301
22:24.650 --> 22:26.019
(Come have a look!)

302
22:26.061 --> 22:27.930
(Hot steamed buns!)

303
22:28.650 --> 22:31.210
(Fresh out of the steamer!)

304
22:31.730 --> 22:33.810
(Come and see!)

305
22:34.420 --> 22:36.860
♪In the name her father gave♪

306
22:37.820 --> 22:43.690
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

307
22:45.660 --> 22:51.060
♪The fate is sealed, a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

308
22:52.090 --> 22:58.420
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

309
23:00.020 --> 23:06.690
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

310
23:07.220 --> 23:12.860
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

311
23:15.020 --> 23:19.060
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

312
23:19.110 --> 23:22.220
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

313
23:22.290 --> 23:25.090
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers♪

314
23:25.490 --> 23:28.490
♪Bright as day for you♪

315
23:28.920 --> 23:31.190
♪Though this world is hard to cross♪

316
23:31.240 --> 23:32.720
♪I'll lead you through♪

317
23:33.030 --> 23:35.820
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

318
23:36.190 --> 23:40.890
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

319
23:49.410 --> 23:50.520
(If you wish to fight a tiger,)

320
23:51.520 --> 23:52.560
(you must first risk your life.)

321
23:54.010 --> 23:58.310
(This is my hunting ground.)

322
23:58.840 --> 23:59.410
(Sheng'an,)

323
23:59.690 --> 24:01.930
(I'm back.)

324
24:03.090 --> 24:05.680
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

325
24:22.170 --> 24:23.450
(I don't know when it began,)

326
24:23.690 --> 24:26.010
(but Sheng'an says you're overbearing)

327
24:26.280 --> 24:27.650
(and won't let the people eat fish.)

328
24:28.650 --> 24:31.170
(The Eastern Palace accepting sea bass now)

329
24:31.840 --> 24:32.840
(may have an ulterior motive.)

330
24:35.320 --> 24:38.760
(Yu Cheng'an, Duke of Zhao, Cav. Gen.) I forbid the people from eating fish?

331
24:39.760 --> 24:41.890
(Army-Inspection Commissioner) This rumor is quite telling.

332
24:44.120 --> 24:44.970
(If that's the case,)

333
24:45.600 --> 24:46.760
(for a treacherous eunuch like me,)

334
24:47.170 --> 24:49.650
(I can least afford to disappoint the Crown Prince.)

335
25:00.820 --> 25:06.220
(Mu Yu, Emperor)

336
25:14.450 --> 25:16.080
I heard that yesterday,

337
25:16.650 --> 25:17.600
a guest visited the Eastern Palace

338
25:18.040 --> 25:21.210
and presented Your Highness with two sea bass.

339
25:21.800 --> 25:22.520
Is that true?

340
25:23.280 --> 25:23.890
Perhaps yes.

341
25:25.120 --> 25:25.800
(Mu Xun, Crown Prince) Perhaps not.

342
25:27.490 --> 25:28.320
I never concern myself

343
25:29.520 --> 25:30.280
with kitchen matters.

344
25:35.930 --> 25:36.960
Oh,

345
25:37.970 --> 25:38.520
Your Highness,

346
25:40.650 --> 25:42.210
you're so young

347
25:42.490 --> 25:43.760
yet your memory is already failing.

348
25:44.890 --> 25:46.040
I've heard that

349
25:46.520 --> 25:49.280
you not only accepted the fish

350
25:49.360 --> 25:50.730
and ate them after they were cooked,

351
25:50.840 --> 25:52.410
but even rewarded the man who brought them.

352
25:53.800 --> 25:54.450
Who would've thought

353
25:55.320 --> 25:56.560
even trifles about the Eastern Palace's meals

354
25:58.210 --> 26:00.040
would reach your ears.

355
26:03.320 --> 26:04.360
Every matter in Sheng'an,

356
26:05.170 --> 26:06.410
great or small,

357
26:07.450 --> 26:10.840
concerns the safety of the imperial nobility.

358
26:11.760 --> 26:12.250
I am duty-bound

359
26:13.080 --> 26:14.010
to inquire.

360
26:17.600 --> 26:17.970
Your Highness,

361
26:20.890 --> 26:22.120
just tell me one thing.

362
26:23.080 --> 26:24.210
Did you receive

363
26:24.560 --> 26:25.320
those two fish

364
26:25.930 --> 26:27.040
or not?

365
26:38.280 --> 26:38.760
Xun.

366
26:40.250 --> 26:40.730
Xun.

367
26:44.520 --> 26:44.890
Your Majesty.

368
26:46.320 --> 26:47.410
Who would've thought?

369
26:48.450 --> 26:50.650
Two mere sea bass

370
26:51.600 --> 26:53.250
could make the heir to the throne

371
26:54.450 --> 26:55.280
so reluctant to answer.

372
26:57.930 --> 26:58.450
Cheng'an,

373
26:59.280 --> 27:00.890
Xun is still a child.

374
27:01.410 --> 27:02.690
Impulsive and hot-tempered,

375
27:03.760 --> 27:04.690
with a poor memory too.

376
27:05.360 --> 27:07.170
Don't hold it against him.

377
27:24.840 --> 27:26.760
Why is Your Highness sweating so much?

378
27:27.970 --> 27:28.730
Could it be

379
27:29.360 --> 27:30.730
the cold night air

380
27:31.730 --> 27:33.040
has given you a chill?

381
27:34.010 --> 27:35.320
You're in the prime of life,

382
27:36.210 --> 27:37.650
yet so frail.

383
27:41.520 --> 27:42.600
For the sake of the realm,

384
27:43.410 --> 27:45.250
you must take better care of yourself.

385
28:01.210 --> 28:01.970
Cheng'an,

386
28:03.360 --> 28:04.690
let it go.

387
28:05.450 --> 28:06.320
After all,

388
28:06.930 --> 28:09.040
you've watched him grow up.

389
28:12.010 --> 28:12.560
Xun,

390
28:13.210 --> 28:14.840
apologize to Lord Yu,

391
28:15.730 --> 28:16.730
and

392
28:17.760 --> 28:19.410
let this matter be settled.

393
28:23.320 --> 28:23.730
Xun.

394
28:44.040 --> 28:44.970
Greetings, Lord Yu.

395
28:45.600 --> 28:46.410
Greetings, Father.

396
28:47.690 --> 28:48.520
I'm back.

397
28:48.800 --> 28:49.320
Danyang, you're back.

398
28:53.690 --> 28:54.280
Rise.

399
28:54.730 --> 28:55.360
Thank you, Father.

400
29:00.520 --> 29:01.650
Brother Xun, you're here too.

401
29:20.800 --> 29:21.650
Princess Danyang.

402
29:23.120 --> 29:23.760
Is there...

403
29:25.600 --> 29:27.930
Is there something on my face?

404
29:31.930 --> 29:33.250
It's been a long time, Lord Yu.

405
29:34.080 --> 29:35.320
I've missed you.

406
29:36.280 --> 29:37.280
On this trip south,

407
29:37.760 --> 29:39.840
I picked up lots of local specialties.

408
29:40.890 --> 29:41.690
As soon as I returned,

409
29:41.840 --> 29:43.490
I sent them straight to your residence.

410
29:44.320 --> 29:45.320
But you weren't there.

411
29:46.010 --> 29:46.690
I guessed

412
29:46.970 --> 29:49.080
you must be in the palace chatting with Father.

413
29:51.760 --> 29:52.600
It seems

414
29:53.170 --> 29:55.040
Your Highness enjoyed

415
29:55.410 --> 29:57.080
your trip very much.

416
29:57.800 --> 29:58.600
Not at all.

417
29:59.690 --> 30:00.760
This trip south

418
30:01.040 --> 30:02.690
was to pray for my mother's soul and help her spirit find peace.

419
30:03.360 --> 30:04.930
I wouldn't dare indulge myself.

420
30:07.800 --> 30:08.280
Is that so?

421
30:09.360 --> 30:11.730
Then why have I heard

422
30:12.210 --> 30:14.080
that along the way, you...

423
30:15.490 --> 30:16.650
Lord Yu,

424
30:17.650 --> 30:18.760
please stop.

425
30:19.450 --> 30:20.930
Brother Xun is still here.

426
30:21.760 --> 30:22.760
If you say it,

427
30:23.280 --> 30:24.010
I'll never be able

428
30:24.730 --> 30:26.080
to show my face again.

429
30:28.320 --> 30:29.320
What is it?

430
30:29.840 --> 30:31.280
Now I'm quite eager to hear.

431
30:32.040 --> 30:32.600
Xun,

432
30:33.360 --> 30:34.170
you may leave.

433
30:35.970 --> 30:36.320
Yes, Father.

434
30:37.120 --> 30:39.080
Please wait, Your Highness!

435
30:52.560 --> 30:53.410
Your Highness,

436
30:55.080 --> 30:58.080
you should heed the lessons of those before you.

437
31:04.080 --> 31:04.360
That's right.

438
31:05.040 --> 31:05.650
Xun,

439
31:06.120 --> 31:07.080
when you return,

440
31:07.280 --> 31:09.730
deal with those cooks from yesterday.

441
31:11.040 --> 31:12.040
From now on,

442
31:12.800 --> 31:14.040
be careful with all ingredients

443
31:14.600 --> 31:16.040
going in and out of the kitchen.

444
31:21.600 --> 31:22.040
Yes, Father.

445
31:43.360 --> 31:44.490
I was wrong.

446
31:46.930 --> 31:47.520
Cheng'an,

447
31:48.490 --> 31:49.760
what has she done wrong again?

448
31:55.560 --> 31:57.170
She hasn't exactly done anything wrong.

449
31:59.250 --> 32:01.210
Princess Danyang was merely

450
32:01.600 --> 32:02.690
indulging in a little youthful romance.

451
32:03.120 --> 32:04.040
It's harmless enough.

452
32:04.560 --> 32:05.280
Youthful romance?

453
32:09.280 --> 32:10.520
Father,

454
32:12.890 --> 32:14.450
I know I was wrong.

455
32:17.840 --> 32:18.250
Your Majesty,

456
32:19.250 --> 32:21.490
enjoy your reunion with Princess Danyang.

457
32:21.800 --> 32:23.690
I'll take my leave now.

458
32:24.840 --> 32:25.970
Lord Yu, rest...

459
32:31.600 --> 32:33.040
Lord Yu, rest well.

460
32:33.490 --> 32:35.080
And take care of yourself.

461
32:35.730 --> 32:36.650
Thank you, Your Majesty!

462
32:45.080 --> 32:45.600
Father,

463
32:46.730 --> 32:47.520
the weather's turned cold

464
32:48.360 --> 32:49.840
and your old ailment has flared up again.

465
32:56.210 --> 32:57.080
It's nothing.

466
33:01.010 --> 33:01.840
But look at you.

467
33:02.520 --> 33:03.210
You must have

468
33:04.250 --> 33:04.930
had a hard journey.

469
33:06.280 --> 33:07.490
Being out on the road

470
33:08.170 --> 33:08.800
isn't hard on me.

471
33:09.450 --> 33:10.600
But you remain in the palace,

472
33:11.890 --> 33:12.730
unable to leave.

473
33:13.890 --> 33:14.600
You're the one who's had it hard.

474
33:20.120 --> 33:22.520
Here's Princess Danyang's gift list.

475
33:23.490 --> 33:24.970
The gifts are in the reception hall.

476
33:25.250 --> 33:26.040
Would you like to look it over?

477
33:26.690 --> 33:27.120
No need.

478
33:27.690 --> 33:28.840
Handle them as you see fit.

479
33:29.840 --> 33:30.210
By the way,

480
33:30.730 --> 33:31.469
(Zheng Xing, Palace Attendant) besides my residence,

481
33:31.511 --> 33:32.800
where else did she send gifts?

482
33:33.970 --> 33:35.490
The Liangyi Hall and the Eastern Palace.

483
33:36.730 --> 33:38.360
What did she send to the Eastern Palace?

484
33:39.010 --> 33:41.450
Female musicians bought in the south.

485
33:43.410 --> 33:44.450
Danyang...

486
33:45.040 --> 33:46.120
She really doesn't know

487
33:47.040 --> 33:48.450
how to cater to anyone's tastes.

488
33:59.730 --> 34:00.760
You're truly wise, Godfather.

489
34:02.890 --> 34:04.840
I heard the cooks at the Eastern Palace

490
34:05.040 --> 34:06.250
have all been taken care of.

491
34:13.600 --> 34:14.010
Your Highness.

492
34:14.930 --> 34:16.160
Endurance is a blade over the heart.

493
34:17.080 --> 34:18.290
I know how much you're suffering.

494
34:19.450 --> 34:20.160
But for now,

495
34:20.970 --> 34:21.770
please endure a little longer.

496
34:26.970 --> 34:28.240
One day,

497
34:29.720 --> 34:31.680
that treacherous eunuch will surely be killed.

498
34:33.450 --> 34:34.520
And this realm

499
34:36.010 --> 34:37.560
will belong to the Mu clan in the end.

500
34:53.970 --> 34:54.410
What is it?

501
34:55.330 --> 34:56.810
(Yu Niang, Eastern Palace Adviser) Princess Danyang has sent gifts.

502
34:57.160 --> 34:58.520
They request that Your Highness receive them in person.

503
35:09.930 --> 35:11.160
Thank your lady for her kindness.

504
35:12.200 --> 35:13.200
Go back where you came from.

505
35:17.680 --> 35:18.600
The gesture is appreciated.

506
35:19.200 --> 35:20.520
I'll escort you ladies back.

507
35:39.330 --> 35:39.850
You?

508
35:41.240 --> 35:42.890
Will Your Highness be free tonight?

509
35:44.290 --> 35:46.770
I'd like to play a piece for you.

510
35:47.520 --> 35:48.680
Prince of Qin Breaking the Battle Array.

511
35:51.720 --> 35:52.080
All right.

512
36:00.600 --> 36:00.930
Danyang,

513
36:02.160 --> 36:02.930
did Father ask you

514
36:03.490 --> 36:04.490
to pass me a message?

515
36:05.120 --> 36:05.600
Your Highness,

516
36:06.560 --> 36:07.770
Princess Danyang

517
36:08.120 --> 36:09.290
is drinking at Cuiyun Tower tonight.

518
36:10.040 --> 36:11.120
She hasn't been to the Eastern Palace tonight.

519
36:15.290 --> 36:16.200
What exactly is this about?

520
36:17.370 --> 36:18.080
This is no place

521
36:18.520 --> 36:19.810
for you to make trouble.

522
36:20.560 --> 36:21.010
I came

523
36:21.720 --> 36:22.640
for one reason only.

524
36:39.810 --> 36:41.410
If Your Highness wishes to achieve this great cause,

525
36:42.520 --> 36:43.850
I am willing to be your blade.

526
36:51.410 --> 36:51.810
Danyang,

527
36:53.640 --> 36:54.200
tell me,

528
36:55.850 --> 36:57.200
is it as I suspect?

529
36:58.080 --> 36:58.640
In the past,

530
36:59.930 --> 37:01.040
I had no choice.

531
37:02.720 --> 37:03.560
But now that I've returned,

532
37:04.290 --> 37:05.490
I refuse to keep living in a daze.

533
37:06.930 --> 37:09.290
I'm willing to help you kill that treacherous eunuch,

534
37:10.010 --> 37:11.240
reclaim power over the realm,

535
37:11.850 --> 37:13.200
and avenge the humiliation of our clan!

536
37:15.120 --> 37:15.560
Danyang,

537
37:17.080 --> 37:18.120
I underestimated

538
37:19.010 --> 37:19.810
you before.

539
37:20.450 --> 37:21.600
I realized it too late.

540
37:23.560 --> 37:24.810
You and I are both of the Mu clan.

541
37:25.850 --> 37:27.930
We share honor and shame, life and death.

542
37:28.930 --> 37:29.410
In the past,

543
37:30.160 --> 37:31.490
I gave in to despair

544
37:32.520 --> 37:33.450
and hid away just to stay alive.

545
37:34.930 --> 37:35.810
Starting today,

546
37:36.810 --> 37:38.600
I'll do all I can to help you.

547
37:40.010 --> 37:41.200
I'm willing to do whatever it takes

548
37:42.080 --> 37:42.850
for this cause,

549
37:43.330 --> 37:44.160
fighting to the death!

550
38:21.100 --> 38:25.020
(Your Highness.)

551
38:28.520 --> 38:29.240
(By now,)

552
38:30.290 --> 38:31.370
(she must've reached Sheng'an.)

553
38:33.680 --> 38:34.770
(Heaven's favored daughter)

554
38:35.720 --> 38:36.640
(has returned home from ten thousand li away.)

555
38:38.330 --> 38:39.770
(She must be fast asleep by now.)

556
38:59.890 --> 39:00.370
Brother,

557
39:01.680 --> 39:02.490
there's something

558
39:03.490 --> 39:04.600
I have no one else to ask.

559
39:06.010 --> 39:08.080
Less than six months after I married into North Jing,

560
39:08.930 --> 39:10.410
I heard of Mother's death.

561
39:12.010 --> 39:13.890
But I remember she was always in good health.

562
39:15.970 --> 39:16.520
How exactly

563
39:17.290 --> 39:18.370
did Mother die?

564
39:24.240 --> 39:25.120
It's a well-kept secret.

565
39:25.890 --> 39:26.680
Even I don't know

566
39:27.600 --> 39:28.520
the full story.

567
39:28.970 --> 39:29.680
I've only heard rumors.

568
39:30.560 --> 39:31.330
I heard

569
39:31.770 --> 39:33.160
that Father and Mother plotted

570
39:33.600 --> 39:35.160
to lure Lord Yu into the palace and kill him.

571
39:35.930 --> 39:37.040
But the plan was exposed

572
39:37.560 --> 39:38.410
and failed at the last moment.

573
39:38.930 --> 39:39.680
That treacherous eunuch confined

574
39:40.410 --> 39:41.330
both Father and Mother.

575
39:43.810 --> 39:44.410
Mother

576
39:45.330 --> 39:46.290
had a fiery temper

577
39:47.330 --> 39:48.200
and died by cutting her own throat.

578
39:50.450 --> 39:52.600
Father fell ill with grief

579
39:54.010 --> 39:55.370
and has remained ill ever since.

580
39:59.560 --> 40:01.080
It must be the deepest wound

581
40:02.010 --> 40:03.240
of Father's life.

582
40:07.680 --> 40:08.890
I'm glad I asked you

583
40:09.490 --> 40:10.200
and not Father.

584
40:12.040 --> 40:13.490
Though I wasn't born to Mother,

585
40:15.160 --> 40:16.010
she always treated me

586
40:16.640 --> 40:17.600
as if I were her own.

587
40:19.240 --> 40:21.080
You're the only daughter Mother bore.

588
40:21.680 --> 40:22.160
Now,

589
40:23.080 --> 40:24.160
her soul rests in the underworld.

590
40:25.240 --> 40:26.240
As your elder brother,

591
40:27.720 --> 40:29.040
I should take good care of you.

592
40:30.490 --> 40:31.370
Danyang, don't worry.

593
40:32.080 --> 40:33.120
Whether we succeed or fail,

594
40:34.160 --> 40:36.120
I'll do all I can to keep you safe.

595
40:38.490 --> 40:38.930
Brother,

596
40:40.970 --> 40:41.850
if I feared death,

597
40:42.770 --> 40:43.810
would I have come to you?

598
40:45.640 --> 40:46.410
Our alliance

599
40:48.560 --> 40:49.680
matters a great deal.

600
40:50.330 --> 40:51.330
The fewer people who know,

601
40:52.200 --> 40:53.120
the safer you'll be.

602
40:54.520 --> 40:55.330
Just now,

603
40:55.680 --> 40:56.810
I thought of a solution.

604
40:59.640 --> 41:01.080
Do you remember my study companion,

605
41:02.200 --> 41:03.120
the Yang family's third son,

606
41:03.640 --> 41:04.160
Yang Si?

607
41:06.810 --> 41:08.640
You and Yang Si were childhood sweethearts.

608
41:09.490 --> 41:10.600
Everyone in the palace saw it.

609
41:12.040 --> 41:13.240
Yang Si is my study companion.

610
41:14.680 --> 41:16.330
Being close to me is part of his duty.

611
41:17.810 --> 41:18.290
How about

612
41:19.240 --> 41:20.560
I arrange your marriage to him?

613
41:21.520 --> 41:22.370
With Yang Si by your side,

614
41:23.040 --> 41:24.040
he'll also do all he can

615
41:24.640 --> 41:25.410
to keep you safe.

616
41:28.640 --> 41:29.120
Brother,

617
41:30.240 --> 41:31.680
it's been years since I saw Yang Si.

618
41:33.290 --> 41:35.010
Our alliance concerns our clan and the realm.

619
41:36.600 --> 41:37.970
No need to involve marriage.

620
41:42.890 --> 41:43.290
Danyang,

621
41:44.490 --> 41:45.370
I trust you, of course.

622
41:46.200 --> 41:47.450
But this would provide another layer of cover

623
41:48.330 --> 41:49.600
and reduce the risks considerably.

624
41:50.770 --> 41:51.520
Even without this alliance

625
41:51.850 --> 41:53.010
between us,

626
41:54.290 --> 41:55.160
with Yang Si involved,

627
41:56.120 --> 41:57.720
we can still act in concert.

628
41:59.890 --> 42:00.160
All right.

629
42:01.160 --> 42:01.770
I understand.

630
42:04.450 --> 42:05.370
I'm a woman, after all.

631
42:06.160 --> 42:07.040
Let me

632
42:07.810 --> 42:08.560
think it over.

633
42:11.010 --> 42:11.370
That's fair.

634
42:14.200 --> 42:15.010
Our lives are already

635
42:15.850 --> 42:16.890
in each other's hands.

636
42:17.810 --> 42:18.240
From now on,

637
42:19.200 --> 42:20.080
there's nothing we can't discuss.

638
42:24.890 --> 42:25.640
It's late.

639
42:25.970 --> 42:27.330
I'll take my leave.

640
42:28.120 --> 42:29.490
Let's discuss this further another day.

641
42:48.200 --> 42:48.720
(Mu Xun,)

642
42:49.970 --> 42:52.010
(you're counting your chickens far too early.)

643
42:55.330 --> 42:56.080
(Or perhaps)

644
42:57.560 --> 42:59.810
(you don't even bother hiding your intentions from me.)

645
43:03.220 --> 43:07.660
(Next Episode Preview)

646
43:11.490 --> 43:11.850
Your Highness.

647
43:13.520 --> 43:14.010
Qilang,

648
43:14.080 --> 43:15.930
come visit my residence tonight.

649
43:17.080 --> 43:18.640
Don't you want to be my Prince Consort?

650
43:18.890 --> 43:19.850
Why do you keep avoiding me?

651
43:20.410 --> 43:22.520
Just stay the night here.

652
43:24.721 --> 43:28.014
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

653
43:30.699 --> 43:35.615
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

654
43:37.809 --> 43:43.654
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

655
43:44.154 --> 43:49.380
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

656
43:52.149 --> 43:56.940
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

657
43:57.776 --> 44:03.855
♪Through trails of mud and blood; let grief drown in your eyes♪

658
44:05.656 --> 44:08.806
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

659
44:08.806 --> 44:10.454
♪Burning bright as a song♪

660
44:10.506 --> 44:14.230
