672
45:06.540 --> 45:09.713
♪My last untouched innocence♪

673
45:10.037 --> 45:13.463
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

674
45:13.696 --> 45:16.921
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

675
45:17.252 --> 45:24.048
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

676
45:24.417 --> 45:28.983
♪May time be free of fear and pain; boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

677
45:29.030 --> 45:31.368
♪You're the only one I need♪

678
45:31.599 --> 45:38.434
